els and people's recognition of this platform, we believe these live streaming e-commerce will generate a long-term impact to those platform e-commerce players.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/10/jdcom-jd-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2022 Q1","e":"jd","d":"2022-05-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kenneth Fong","x":"How much more, and what are the ways that we should expect for further cost reduction or optimization over next two quarters?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/17/jdcom-jd-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2022 Q2","e":"jd","d":"2022-08-23","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Ronald Keung","x":"So for this year, do we have any strategic strategy on categories, delivery formats, and shopping formats, even live streaming?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/23/jdcom-jd-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2022 Q2","e":"jd","d":"2022-08-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lei Xu","x":"And because of the restructuring of our JD business, in the short term, we might leave some users.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/23/jdcom-jd-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2022 Q4","e":"jd","d":"2023-03-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lei Xu","x":"As such, we have gone through numerous bottom-up optimizations, including further streamlining our promotional programs and improving our traffic allocation mechanisms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/09/jdcom-jd-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2022 Q4","e":"jd","d":"2023-03-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lei Xu","x":"Admittedly, we may experience short-term impact on our performance as we further educate users, reinvigorate JD's reputation for providing the best prices, optimize our product mix, and streamline internal mechanisms and procedures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/03/09/jdcom-jd-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2023 Q1","e":"jd","d":"2023-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lei Xu","x":"We recently rolled out an organizational readjustment for core segments, such as JD Retail and JD Logistics, with the purpose of further streamlining company hierarchy, building a more flat, nimble, and efficient management structure and further empowering front-line business teams.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/11/jdcom-jd-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2023 Q1","e":"jd","d":"2023-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sandy Xu","x":"Let me answer the question about the organization of restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/11/jdcom-jd-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2023 Q2","e":"jd","d":"2023-08-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sandy Xu","x":"As we have talked a lot about our business development today, now, I'd like to share some color on the progress of our organizational restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/16/jdcom-jd-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2023 Q2","e":"jd","d":"2023-08-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sandy Xu","x":"So far, the restructuring is progressing as expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/16/jdcom-jd-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2023 Q3","e":"jd","d":"2023-11-15","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sandy Xu","x":"JD's live streaming sessions hosted by our own category managers proved very popular with users and brands during our Singles Day Promotion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/15/jdcom-jd-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JD 2023 Q3","e":"jd","d":"2023-11-15","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sandy Xu","x":"What's unique about JD's live streaming is that not only are the category managers the experts for the pro